# Map Tiles API key for Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles (local dev).
# Enable "Map Tiles API" in Google Cloud, then:
#   cp .env.example .env
# Restart `npm run dev`.
#
# For GitHub Pages, prefer sealing a key (see nostr/README.md) or let
# visitors paste their own / use free maps. Restrict keys by HTTP referrer.
VITE_GOOGLE_TILES_API_KEY=
